  "type": "font",
  "name": "Info font",
  "notes": "Thin capitals for short information lines, drawn as sprites over the map: each letter is 5 x 6 pixels with 1-pixel strokes, cream on its upper half and gold below, inside a dark outline that touches its corners too, so it reads on grass, rock or the cave. Lighter than the bold floating-word font (font_float) and outlined all around, unlike the menus' white letters with a shadow (font_default). Used on the menu map's bottom line (the best time at a sign, the items picked up in the garden) and for the monster picker's type. Digits and : - + % / ! ? . ( ) are there for times and boosts.",
